e=\"width: 1289px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604171821-wywo0.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-18 12:53:52','2026-04-23 11:14:04',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,413,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:14:04'),(414,1,1,'In the Residents module, the Bulk Upload section is not clearly defined and may confuse users. Currently, only “Download Template” and “View Reports” options are available, but there is no Upload button to upload the filled template.','<img style=\"width: 1276px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201108-7oqpo.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n🔹 1. Add Section Label (Most Important)\r\n\r\nRight now buttons look generic. Add a clear heading:\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nBulk Upload Residents\r\n\r\nThis instantly tells users what this section is for.\r\n\r\n🔹 2. Improve Button Labels (More Action-Oriented)\r\n\r\nMake the buttons more self-explanatory:\r\n\r\nDownload Template ➝ ✅ “Download Upload Template”\r\nView All Reports ➝ ✅ “View Upload Reports”\r\n\r\n👉 This removes confusion about what “reports” means.\r\n\r\n🔹 3. Add Helper Text (Very Important for Fresh Users)\r\n\r\nAdd a small description below the title:\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nUpload multiple residents at once using the template. Download the format, fill in the details, and upload the file.\r\n\r\n🔹 4. Add Upload Button (Missing Key Action)\r\n\r\nCurrently, only template + reports are there. Add:\r\n\r\n✅ “Upload File” button (Primary CTA)\r\n\r\nSo flow becomes:\r\n\r\nDownload Template\r\nFill Data\r\nUpload File\r\nView Report\r\n🔹 5. Use Icons for Better Understanding\r\n\r\nAdd meaningful icons:\r\n\r\n📥 Download Template\r\n📤 Upload File\r\n📊 View Reports\r\n\r\nThis improves quick recognition.\r\n\r\n🔹 6. Add Tooltip / Info Icon\r\n\r\nAdd small (i) icon near section:\r\n\r\nTooltip Example:\r\n\r\nUse the template to upload residents in bulk. Only valid formats will be accepted.\r\n\r\n🔹 7. Show Last Upload Status (Advanced UX)\r\n\r\nBelow buttons, show:\r\n\r\nLast uploaded file name\r\nStatus: ✅ Success / ❌ Failed\r\nDate & time\r\n🔹 8. Add Validation Info (Optional but Useful)\r\n\r\nSmall note:\r\n\r\nSupported format: .xlsx | Max size: 5MB',NULL,NULL,5,12,3,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-20 05:43:13','2026-04-23 11:13:12',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,414,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:13:12'),(415,1,1,'After uploading the bulk upload file, two messages are shown: “Bulk upload started” and “Bulk upload failed.” However, there are no details explaining how the process started or why it failed, which makes it difficult for the user to understand the issue.','<img style=\"width: 1291px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201113-ozuce.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 1271px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201113-akwwd.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\nExpected Result:\r\nClear and consistent status messages should be displayed:\r\nUpload Started (with progress indicator)\r\nUpload Completed (Success / Partial / Failed)\r\nSystem should display:\r\nTotal records, successful records, failed records\r\nReason for failure (file format, validation error, etc.)\r\nProvide actionable options:\r\nView Upload Report\r\nDownload Error Report\r\nRetry Upload',NULL,NULL,5,12,3,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-20 05:51:39','2026-04-23 11:12:32',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,415,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:12:32'),(416,1,1,'Resident--> Check font family once.','<img style=\"width: 981px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201133-ljl9c.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-20 06:04:01','2026-04-23 11:05:29',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,416,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:05:29'),(417,1,1,'Resident → Added Flat → Delete: The added flat is deleted instantly without any confirmation. Instead, the system should prompt a confirmation message before deleting the flat.','<img style=\"width: 1292px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201623-ptna9.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-20 10:55:12','2026-04-23 11:04:54',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,417,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:04:54'),(418,1,1,'Resident → Transfer Flat: If the resident is inactive, the \"Transfer Flat\" option should be disabled.','<img style=\"width: 1260px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201645-buo6d.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-20 11:19:06','2026-04-23 11:04:11',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,418,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:04:11'),(419,1,1,'Society Onboarding--> Flat History--> Add asterisk for the mandatory fields.','<img style=\"width: 1231px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604201724-bqsnq.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-04-20 11:54:48','2026-04-23 11:02:50',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,419,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 11:02:50'),(420,1,1,'Residents were added by the admin through bulk upload, and although the upload was successful, the flat assignment is not reflected in the flat history.','<img style=\"width: 1268px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604211046-swyo2.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 1254px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604211057-d3zlq.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 1270px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604211058-wlctl.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,5,'2026-04-21 05:28:07','2026-05-08 09:12:17',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,420,1,2,0,'2026-05-08 09:12:17'),(421,1,1,'I uploaded an incorrect template file in the bulk upload, but the file is not displayed here, although the message shows that the upload was completed.','<img style=\"width: 1282px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604211120-clxsq.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-04-21 05:52:17','2026-04-23 10:59:23',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,421,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 10:59:23'),(422,1,1,'Resident added first time via bulk upload and the file uploaded but in the next time i uploads the same file, but the shown messgae is wrong as uload failed instead of showing teh correct duplicate eroror messgae.','<img style=\"width: 1286px;\" src=\"clipboard-202604211127-y4es9.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-04-21 05:57:59','2026-04-23 10:58:44',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,422,1,2,0,'2026-04-23 10:58:44'),(423,1,1,'The resident was added successfully via bulk upload the first time. However, when uploading the same file again, the system shows an incorrect message ‘Upload Failed’ instead of displaying the correct duplicate error messag