Accounts--> MAke one master for the all of these.','<img style=\"width: 1567px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311234-9b6xh.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-07-31 07:05:18','2026-08-10 11:39:22',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1971,1,2,0,'2026-08-10 11:39:22'),(1972,1,1,'Fedearion --> Invoice--> No need of payment mode while creating a invoice.','<img style=\"width: 1562px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311245-kmtih.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-07-31 07:15:56','2026-08-10 11:38:55',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1972,1,2,0,'2026-08-10 11:38:55'),(1973,4,1,'Treasurer App - make changes for line item masters accounts dropdown ','The backend now requires a type on line-item categories. If the app\'s \"Add Category\" screen doesn\'t send it, POST /app-treasurer/masters/line-item-categories will return 400 – \"Category type is required and must be INCOME or EXPENSE.\"\r\n\r\nApp must: add a Type picker (Income / Expense) to the category add/edit screen and send it:\r\n\r\n\r\nPOST /app-treasurer/masters/line-item-categories\r\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\r\n{ \"name\": \"Repairs\", \"description\": \"...\", \"type\": \"EXPENSE\" }\r\ntype = \"INCOME\" or \"EXPENSE\" (uppercase). Required on create; allowed on update (PUT /…/line-item-categories/:id).\r\nSystem categories (Income/Expense) can\'t be edited — hide/disable the type field for those.\r\nRecommended (matches the web UX)\r\nThe category list now returns the type on every category:\r\n\r\n\r\nGET /app-treasurer/masters/line-item-categories\r\n→ [ { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Expense\", \"type\": \"EXPENSE\", ... }, ... ]\r\nIn the line-item add/edit screen, use it to filter the Default Account picker by the selected category\'s type:\r\n\r\nCategory type = \"INCOME\" → show only Income accounts.\r\nCategory type = \"EXPENSE\" → show only Expense accounts.\r\nCategory type = null (older custom categories) → show all accounts (fallback).\r\nAccount type comes from the account master (GET /app-treasurer/masters/accounts → each account has a type field like INCOME/EXPENSE). When the category changes, clear a selected default account that no longer matches. This is the same logic I put in the web — it\'s what makes the account auto-fill later in the invoice/bill/expense forms (the whole point of your original question).',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-07-31 07:21:27','2026-09-02 06:35:36','2026-07-31',0,NULL,NULL,1973,1,2,0,'2026-09-02 06:35:36'),(1974,1,1,'Fedeartion--> Accounts--> Billing period have no validations, thre should be from date and to date.','<img style=\"width: 1413px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311346-3ny9e.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-07-31 08:17:44','2026-08-10 11:38:31',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1974,1,2,0,'2026-08-10 11:38:31'),(1975,1,1,'Federation--> Line items--> There is no validation for the GST. apply please.','<img style=\"width: 1583px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311350-cg0qu.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-07-31 08:21:00','2026-08-12 07:04:02',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1975,1,2,0,'2026-08-12 07:04:02'),(1976,1,1,'Federation--> Accounts--> Add serial number column in the invoice.','<img style=\"width: 1501px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311458-yuvj4.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-07-31 09:29:36','2026-08-06 13:29:21',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1976,1,2,0,'2026-08-06 13:29:21'),(1977,1,1,'Federation -> if society apid 1000 advance to dederation, and federation generate the invoice of 900 rs. against the society that time where is to shown that 900 paid using this advance and 100 rs. balance is pending till to the federation.','<img style=\"width: 1599px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311504-oddtg.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-07-31 09:36:45','2026-08-10 11:37:52',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1977,1,2,0,'2026-08-10 11:37:52'),(1978,1,1,'If invoice is in draft, then the cancel invoice button should be dispalyed in the listing.','<img style=\"width: 1599px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607311510-qgbno.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-07