 My Advance option - show in Pay Advance screen','What the Pay Advance screen now calls\r\n\r\nPOST /api/app-resident/advance/summary with { \"flatId\": \"...\", \"summaryOnly\": true }\r\n\r\n\r\n{ \"summary\": { \"availableBalance\": 400, \"totalAdvancePaid\": 770,\r\n               \"totalAdjusted\": 370, \"advanceCount\": 2 },\r\n  \"bySource\": [], \"advances\": [], \"usage\": [] }\r\nsummaryOnly runs one aggregate instead of four queries — the screen only needs the headline. The SQL is byte-for-byte the same aggregate the full My Advance screen uses (a test asserts this), so the two screens can never show different numbers.\r\n\r\nAfter a successful payment, no second call needed\r\n\r\nPOST /api/app-resident/advance now returns the updated balance alongside the advance:\r\n\r\n\r\n{ \"id\": \"...\", \"advanceNo\": \"ADV-IN-...\", \"amount\": 500, ..., \"advanceBalance\": 900 }\r\nExisting fields are unchanged (the balance is just added), so nothing in the app breaks. It\'s computed with the same formula, and best-effort — if that lookup fails, the payment still returns 201 with advanceBalance: null.\r\n\r\nSuggested screen\r\n\r\nAvailable Advance\r\n₹400.00                       ← summary.availableBalance\r\nPaid ₹770.00 · Used ₹370.00   ← optional second line\r\n\r\n[ View My Advance ]           ← same endpoint without summaryOnly\r\n[ Pay Advance ]               ← existing POST /advance\r\nAfter the payment succeeds, set the figure from advanceBalance in the response.',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,13,6,'2026-09-01 09:43:45','2026-09-03 13:22:29',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2385,1,2,0,'2026-09-03 13:22:29'),(2386,1,1,'society staff arrival at federation gate feature','given on teams please check and ask',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,6,'2026-09-02 10:53:56','2026-09-10 13:05:42',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2386,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:05:42'),(2387,1,1,'remove marked as arrived button from society secuirty app if society is under federation','ask orally ',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-09-02 10:55:02','2026-09-04 10:45:33',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2387,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:45:33'),(2388,1,1,'Resident App--> Ledger--> Click on doenload--> Shown the error.','<img style=\"width: 292px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609021815-iqrnz.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,10,9,2,NULL,7,6,'2026-09-02 12:45:55','2026-09-16 07:19:08',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2388,1,2,0,NULL),(2389,1,1,'Treasurer App--> PLease check the total once, because it shown total unpaid value wrong. ','<img style=\"width: 314px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609021816-vjbhg.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-02 12:47:50','2026-09-03 13:11:24',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2389,1,2,0,'2026-09-03 13:11:24'),(2390,1,1,'Treasurer app - flat ledger - add pagination all entries are not showing , showing only first page','Endpoint\r\n\r\n\r\nPOST /api/app-treasurer/flat-ledger/summary\r\nAuthorization: Bearer <treasurer token>\r\nRequest body (all optional except paging)\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"page\": 1,\r\n  \"limit\": 10,\r\n  \"search\": \"\",\r\n  \"status\": \"\",\r\n  \"buildingId\": \"\",\r\n  \"wingId\": \"\",\r\n  \"flatId\": \"\"\r\n}\r\nResponse\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"flats\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"flatId\": \"457b9830-…\",\r\n        \"flatNumber\": \"1A-A01\",\r\n        \"buildingName\": \"1\",\r\n        \"wingName\": \"A\",\r\n        \"residents\": [{ \"name\": \"Hitesh\", \"mobile\": \"891111111\", \"isPrimary\": true }],\r\n        \"totalBilled\": 0,\r\n        \"totalPaid\": 0,\r\n        \"totalPending\": 0,\r\n        \"advanceBalance\": 600,\r\n        \"status\": \"CLEAR\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"pagination\": {\r\n    \"currentPage\": 1,\r\n    \"totalPages\": 2,\r\n    \"totalItems\": 16,\r\n    \"pageSize\": 10\r\n  },\r\n  \"summary\": {\r\n    \"totalBilled\": 500,\r\n    \"totalPaid\": 0,\r\n    \"totalPending\": 500,\r\n    \"totalAdvanceBalance\": 3500,\r\n    \"flatCount\": 16\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nWhat to change in the app \r\n\r\nInfinite scroll. Call page: 1, then page: 2 … while currentPage < totalPages, appending to the list. Usually nicer on mobile.\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-03 07:33:01','2026-09-04 10:43:40',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2390,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:43:40'),(2391,1,1,'federation security - change ui ','<img style=\"width: 414px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609031506-br3rq.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-03 09:37:18','2026-09-04 10:39:40',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2391,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:39:40'),(2392,1,1,'federation security app - need to change design ','<img style=\"width: 451px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609031508-kgjuc.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-03 09:38:27','2026-09-04 10:38:45',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2392,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:38:45'),(2393,1,1,'federation security app - check alignments ','<img style=\"width: 434px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609031509-vkpfp.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-03 09:39:33','2026-09-04 10:36:56',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2393,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:36:56'),(2394,1,1,'federation security app - button ui and give that name \"Mark as Arrived\"  instead of \"Admit Pre-Approved\"','<img style=\"width: 458px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609031510-fy3gk.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-03 09:42:40','2026-09-04 10:36:03',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2394,1,2,0,'2026-09-04 10:36:03'),(2395,1,1,'Treasurer Dashboard and Reports - ask orally',' GET /app-treasurer/dashboard and /app-treasurer/reports/dashboard now return openingBalanceCollected and totalCollected. Render totalCollected \r\n\r\n\r\nTotal Collected                    ₹500\r\nInvoices ₹200 · Opening Balance ₹300\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,7,'2026-09-03 10:12:16','2026-09-16 07:03:52',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2395,1,2,0,'2026-09-16 07:03:52'),(2396,1,1,'treasurer app - flat ledger - add one more column credit note ','the same endpoint (POST /app-treasurer/flat-ledger/summary) now returns totalCredited on every flat row and on summary.',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-09-03 10:52:45','2026-09-10 06:39:22'