src=\"clipboard-202609071026-dhlct.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-07 04:58:17','2026-09-10 09:26:17',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2419,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 09:26:17'),(2420,1,1,'Fed Security--> Society Directory--> All the societies dropdown should be open from the top, not from the bottom.','<img style=\"width: 289px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071039-amkhq.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 05:10:09','2026-09-10 09:26:47',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2420,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 09:26:47'),(2421,1,1,'Fed Security--> Societies--> Need to shown the societies total flats count.','<img style=\"width: 286px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071042-me0xc.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-07 05:12:56','2026-09-10 11:48:13',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2421,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 11:48:13'),(2422,1,1,'Fed Security--> Log Visitor--> The visitor photo is also mandatory field. make it mandatory.','<img style=\"width: 292px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071102-82lh9.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 05:33:42','2026-09-10 09:44:37',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2422,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 09:44:37'),(2423,1,1,'Federation Admin--> Support Ticket--> Except chrome other browsers are not support the status updatations from open to inprocess and resolved. Ask me I will tell you.','<img style=\"width: 1588px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071129-gfpcp.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,9,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 06:01:51','2026-09-09 12:33:06',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2423,1,2,0,'2026-09-09 12:33:06'),(2424,1,1,'Treasurer App - Bills from federation screen - Remove pay now button also remove line item option ','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-09-07 06:02:15','2026-09-10 13:05:32',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2424,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:05:32'),(2425,1,1,'Treasurer App - Bills from federation screen - cancel invoice chip - add proper in both screen also add cancelled GET …/federation-invoices?status=CANCELLED , so add a Cancelled chip to that filter row next to All / Sent / Partially Paid / Paid / Overdue','',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,6,'2026-09-07 06:02:58','2026-09-10 09:58:24',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2425,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 09:58:24'),(2426,1,1,'Fed Security--> Privacy policy ad terms and conditions, should be in dark mode. ','<img style=\"width: 288px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071201-o3w4r.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 06:36:38','2026-09-08 12:52:57',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2426,1,2,0,'2026-09-08 12:52:57'),(2427,1,1,'FedbSecurity--> Dark mode--> It should be clear.','<img style=\"width: 299px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071207-f9hji.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 319px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071207-dkao9.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 06:37:45','2026-09-10 10:01:24',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2427,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:01:24'),(2428,1,1,'Federation Security--> Unable to unerstand this in both light and dark mode.','<img style=\"width: 347px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071217-hbsx5.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 06:48:00','2026-09-10 10:02:03',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2428,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:02:03'),(2429,1,1,'Treasurer app - make new menu \"My Advance\" near Bills From Federation ','New screen: \"My Advance\" (Treasurer App)\r\nWhere: Bills from Federation → add a third tab next to Invoices and Payment History.\r\n\r\nWhy: A society sometimes pays the federation in advance. Today the society cannot see that money anywhere. It only notices when a later bill comes out smaller. This screen shows how much advance money is left.\r\n\r\nImportant: This screen is view only. No add, no edit. The federation records advances, not the society.\r\n\r\nAPI to call\r\n\r\nGET /api/app-treasurer/federation-invoices/my-advances\r\nAuthorization: Bearer <treasurer app token>\r\nOptional query params: status (ACTIVE / FULLY_APPLIED / CANCELLED), fromDate, toDate, page, limit\r\n\r\nDo not send societyId — the server takes it from the token.\r\n\r\nWhat comes back\r\nSame envelope as the existing my-payments API:\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"stats\": {\r\n      \"availableBalance\": 220,\r\n      \"totalAdvanceAmount\": 440,\r\n      \"totalAppliedAmount\": 220,\r\n      \"activeCount\": 1,\r\n      \"fullyAppliedCount\": 1\r\n    },\r\n    \"data\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"advanceDate\": \"2026-08-27\",\r\n        \"amount\": \"290.00\",\r\n        \"appliedAmount\": \"70.00\",\r\n        \"remainingAmount\": \"220.00\",\r\n        \"paymentMode\": \"BANK_TRANSFER\",\r\n        \"referenceNo\": null,\r\n        \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\r\n        \"statusLabel\": \"Active\",\r\n        \"federationName\": \"rameshwari fedration\",\r\n        \"notes\": null,\r\n        \"appliedTo\": [\r\n          { \"invoiceNo\": \"FED-FY2026-2027-00003\", \"appliedAmount\": 70, \"appliedAt\": \"...\" }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"total\": 2, \"page\": 1, \"limit\": 20\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nWhat to show\r\nTop cards (take these from stats):\r\n\r\nCard	Field\r\nAvailable Balance	availableBalance ← the main number\r\nTotal Paid in Advance	totalAdvanceAmount\r\nUsed Against Bills	totalAppliedAmount\r\nActive / Fully Used	activeCount / fullyAppliedCount\r\nList (each row): Date · Amount · Used · Remaining · Mode · Status chip · which bills it was used against (appliedTo)\r\n\r\nThree rules please follow\r\nTake the cards from stats, not by adding up the list. stats covers all advances; the list is only one page. If you add up the page, the balance will change when the user goes to page 2.\r\nShow statusLabel on the chip, not status. statusLabel is already correct English (\"Active\", \"Fully Applied\", \"Cancelled\"). Use status only for your own logic.\r\nCancelled rows still appear in the list but are not counted in the money. That is correct, please don\'t hide them.',NULL,NULL,3,8,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-09-07 08:53:14','2026-09-16 07:11:53',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2429,1,2,0,NULL),(2430,1,1,'Treasurer App - Bills from federation screen - credit note reflection not showing ','Screen 1 — Invoices list (Bills from Federation)\r\nAPI: GET /api/app-treasurer/federation-invoices\r\n\r\nEach invoice card shows Total Amount / Paid Amount / Outstanding.\r\n\r\nFor the Outstanding line, use the outstanding field that now comes in each row of data.data[].\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"invoiceNo\": \"FED-FY2026-27-00007\",\r\n  \"totalAmount\": \"500.00\",\r\n  \"paidAmount\": \"0.00\",\r\n  \"creditedAmount\": \"100.00\",\r\n  \"outstanding\": 400          ← show this\r\n}\r\nIn your screenshot this card shows ₹500. It should show ₹400.\r\n\r\nDon\'t change the four coloured chips at the top (Outstanding ₹1,280 / PAID / Total / Overdue). Those come from data.stats and are already correct.\r\n\r\nScreen 2 — Invoice Details\r\nAPI: GET /api/app-treasurer/federation-invoices/{id}\r\n\r\nSame field, but at the top level of data:\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"invoiceNo\": \"FED-FY2026-27-00007\",\r\n  \"totalAmount\": \"500.00\",\r\n  \"paidAmount\": \"0.00\",\r\n  \"creditedAmount\": \"100.00\",\r\n  \"outstanding\": 400          ← show this\r\n}\r\nYour detail screen also shows ₹500 — should be ₹400.\r\n\r\nThe rule for both\r\nDo not calculate totalAmount − paidAmount in the app. That\'s what\'s wrong today, and it breaks in two ways:\r\n\r\nCredit notes are missed. A ₹500 bill with a ₹100 credit note really owes ₹400.\r\nCancelled bills look unpaid. A cancelled ₹500 bill owes ₹0, but total − paid says ₹500.\r\nThe server already handles both. Just display outstanding.\r\n\r\nIf you also want to show the credit on screen, creditedAmount is there too — e.g. \"Credit Note −₹100\", the way the federation web shows it.',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,13,4,'2026-09-07 09:10:10','2026-09-10 13:02:24',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2430,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:02:24'),(2431,1,1,'Notification — notification is not received when adding/performing an action from the Federation.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:18:45','2026-09-10 11:46:39',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2431,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 11:46:39'),(2432,1,1,'Advance Option — Advance option should be mandatory for each society in the Resident App.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:19:08','2026-09-10 11:46:25',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2432,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 11:46:25'),(2433,1,1,'When adding Federation Staff, the Dashboard menu should be selectable by default.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:22:50','2026-09-10 13:02:11',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2433,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:02:11'),(2434,1,1,'federation security app - Visitor list -Pending Approval\" showing wrong visitors','Use the new field awaitingApproval that now comes with every visitor.\r\n\r\n\r\nGET /api/visitormanagement/federation-gate/visitors\r\nEach visitor now has:\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"Raj\",\r\n  \"status\": \"LEAVE_AT_GATE\",\r\n  \"isApproved\": false,\r\n  \"awaitingApproval\": false     ← use this one\r\n}\r\nawaitingApproval: true → resident has not answered yet → show in Pending Approval\r\nawaitingApproval: false → resident already answered → do not show in Pending\r\nPlease do not use isApproved for the pending list any more.',NULL,NULL,3,8,2,NULL,13,5,'2026-09-07 09:23:33','2026-09-12 04:50:43',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2434,1,2,0,NULL),(2435,1,1,'Federation Staff Management → Permissions are not displayed completely in the listing.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:24:01','2026-09-10 13:01:52',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2435,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:01:52'),(2436,1,1,'Remove late fees option from the federation permission staff.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:24:49','2026-09-10 13:01:28',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2436,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 13:01:28'),(2437,1,1,'Federation Admin → Security Create → Add a delete option/icon for the security photo.','',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 09:26:20','2026-09-10 11:43:36',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2437,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 11:43:36'),(2438,1,1,'federation security app - Pre-approved request -Scheduled Visit time showing twice','<img style=\"width: 538px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071507-fn751.png\"><br>\r\n{\r\n  \"scheduledVisitDate\": \"2026-09-07\",\r\n  \"scheduledVisitTime\": \"15:01:00\",\r\n  \"scheduledVisitLabel\": \"07/09/2026 03:01 PM\"     ← use this one\r\n}\r\nShow scheduledVisitLabel as-is. Do not format it, do not parse it, do not join the date and time yourself.\r\n\r\nIt is null when there is no schedule (normal visitors — only pre-approved ones have one), so just hide the row when it\'s null.',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-07 09:38:06','2026-09-10 10:04:49',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2438,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:04:49'),(2439,1,1,'Treasurer App--> Bill From Federation - show dues also','Bills from Federation: the invoices summary now includes stats.openingBalanceDue. When it\'s above 0, show it as its own card, e.g. \"Opening Balance Due ₹10,000\". Do not add it into the Outstanding figure. Full detail is at GET /api/app-treasurer/federation-invoices/my-opening-balance',NULL,NULL,3,8,2,NULL,13,2,'2026-09-07 09:53:31','2026-09-08 11:34:46',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2439,1,2,0,NULL),(2440,1,1,'resident App--> While adding the tenant, if resident have two flats, when resident have two flats then, it should be select only single, restrict the multi selection here.','<img style=\"width: 261px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071721-jdl2q.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-07 11:53:07','2026-09-10 10:07:06',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2440,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:07:06'),(2441,1,1,'Residents App--> Vehicle information--> Remove validation for teh vehicla number field.','<img style=\"width: 290px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071731-k1mxq.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-07 12:01:57','2026-09-10 10:07:35',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2441,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:07:35'),(2442,1,1,'Residents App--> Add staff--> Make it visible.','<img style=\"width: 295px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609071736-eflne.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-07 12:06:30','2026-09-10 10:08:15',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2442,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:08:15'),(2443,1,1,'Residents App--> Add staff--> If atleast one document is required then give the mandatory asterisk.','',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-07 12:09:50','2026-09-10 10:08:42',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2443,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 10:08:42'),(2444,1,1,'Society admin--> Generate password and sent mail--> MAil not received in the registered mail id. please check the issue.','<img style=\"width: 1566px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609081625-76ore.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,9,2,NULL,7,4,'2026-09-08 10:55:07','2026-09-09 13:02:06',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2444,1,2,0,'2026-09-09 13:02:06'),(2445,1,1,'Avigo Admin--> PAyment gateway master is disable from master section but shown in the payment configuration screen.','<img style=\"width: 1594px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609091527-32jro.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 1576px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609091528-jiavg.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,9,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-09 09:58:34','2026-09-09 13:03:08',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2445,1,2,0,'2026-09-09 13:03:08'),(2446,1,1,'Resident App - my staff - toggle issue','',NULL,NULL,3,8,2,NULL,13,6,'2026-09-09 10:16:36','2026-09-12 04:55:00',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2446,1,2,0,NULL),(2447,1,1,'Treasurer app - please add notice and announcement menu ','Ravindra Kandekar \r\nPOST /api/resident-onboarding/notices/list — list\r\nGET /api/resident-onboarding/notices/categories\r\nGET /api/resident-onboarding/notices/months\r\nGET /api/resident-onboarding/notices/:id — detail\r\nGET /api/resident-onboarding/notices/:id/attachments\r\nGET /api/resident-onboarding/notices/:id/attachments/:attachmentId/view\r\n\r\n{{base_url}}/api/resident-onboarding/notices/list\r\n\r\n{\r\n    \"success\": true,\r\n    \"code\": \"SUCCESS\",\r\n    \"message\": \"Your request was completed successfully.\",\r\n    \"appCode\": 1000,\r\n    \"httpStatus\": 200,\r\n    \"data\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"_id\": \"6aa1317f2d18ae16b21a2691\",\r\n            \"title\": \"Awfscaegswgrter\",\r\n            \"description\": \"<p>asdfvbgv cxsxdertghbvcdsetrgh</p>\",\r\n            \"societyId\": \"aa5a6606-b1f9-4dbf-ae88-935099bdc115\",\r\n            \"category_id\": \"99776