,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,4,'2026-09-10 06:31:57','2026-09-10 12:55:51',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2460,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:55:51'),(2461,1,1,'Change the dark mode blue color.','<img style=\"width: 296px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609101207-tgfeo.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-10 06:38:29','2026-09-10 12:54:52',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2461,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:54:52'),(2462,1,1,'federation security app - log visitor - add two buttons Send for approval and Allow direct entry ','on the LOG VISITOR AT GATE screen, replace the single Log Visitor button with the same two the society app has:\r\n\r\nSend For Approval → the current call, unchanged.\r\nAllow Direct Entry → the same call with isDirectEntry: true added to the form data.',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-10 06:40:34','2026-09-10 12:54:19',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2462,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:54:19'),(2463,1,1,'Rename it to society Security.','<img style=\"width: 286px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609101224-zh0j6.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-10 06:55:10','2026-09-10 12:52:35',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2463,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:52:35'),(2464,1,1,'PLease check whay this come in shankars phone.','<img style=\"width: 296px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609101446-tmzon.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\nSamsung\r\ngalaxy m11\r\n4 G\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-10 09:17:29','2026-09-11 05:30:29',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2464,1,2,0,'2026-09-11 05:30:29'),(2465,1,1,'Treasurer App - Bills from federation  - remove minus sign from credit note amount ','login treasurer - 66666666661\r\n<img style=\"width: 595px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609101509-zpyoh.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,8,2,NULL,13,3,'2026-09-10 09:39:36','2026-09-10 12:51:50',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2465,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:51:50'),(2466,1,1,'Society Admin--> Treasure module--> Notices and announcements--> PLease check that why this error occured.','<img style=\"width: 1596px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609101709-j1fmp.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,13,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-10 11:40:00','2026-09-10 12:41:13',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2466,1,2,0,'2026-09-10 12:41:13'),(2467,1,1,'Treasurer App - Bills from federation - show line item name also in invoice ','GET /api/app-treasurer/federation-invoices/:id\r\nThat response has a list called items — those are the bill\'s line rows. I have added one new field to each row: lineItemName.\r\n\r\nWhat to do\r\n\r\nOn the bill detail screen, where you show each line row, show lineItemName.\r\n\r\nWhy a fallback is needed\r\n\r\nSometimes lineItemName will be empty. So check in this order and show the first one that has a value:\r\n\r\nlineItemName — the charge name the federation billed under (this is the one we want)\r\nserviceName — used only for service-type bills, which have no line item\r\ndescription — free text the federation typed (this is what the app shows today)\r\nIf all three are empty, show —\r\nIn simple code\r\n\r\n\r\nconst label = item.lineItemName || item.serviceName || item.description || \'—\';',NULL,NULL,3,8,2,NULL,13,2,'2026-09-10 12:22:07','2026-09-12 04:24:51',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2467,1,2,0,NULL),(2468,1,14,'Conatct us--> On hover of submit button the icon is not shown.','<img style=\"width: 1571px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609111017-hgr01.png\"><br>\r\n<img style=\"width: 1561px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609111018-7v8er.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,2,'2026-09-11 04:48:15','2026-09-11 04:52:52',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2468,1,2,0,'2026-09-11 04:52:52'),(2469,1,19,'Contact us--> On hover of submit button the icon gets disable mode. it should be visible.','<img style=\"width: 1561px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609111023-bys8y.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-11 04:53:40','2026-09-11 12:43:08',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2469,1,2,0,'2026-09-11 12:43:08'),(2470,2,19,'Header--> Logo change.','<img style=\"width: 1586px;\" src=\"clipboard-202609111023-jntpl.png\"><br>\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,12,2,NULL,7,3,'2026-09-11 04:54:04','2026-09-11 12:43:50',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2470,1,2,0,'2026-09-11 12:43:50'),(2471,1,19,'Contact us--> After submitti