y Feature — App API\r\nRule (enforced server-side everywhere): penalty is an optional percentage, 0–21% max (government cap).\r\n\r\nThere are two places a penalty % is set, matching the two admin pages you referenced. Both use the same backend as admin, so behavior is identical.\r\n\r\n1. Maintenance Billing Setup — recurring auto-invoices\r\ntreasurer-maintenance-billing-setup page\r\n\r\nAuth: Bearer <token> (society_treasurer app user) · app-version + rate-limit headers as usual.\r\n\r\nAction	App endpoint\r\nCreate	POST /api/app-treasurer/maintenance/setup\r\nUpdate	PUT /api/app-treasurer/maintenance/setup/:id\r\nRead	GET /api/app-treasurer/maintenance/setup · GET /api/app-treasurer/maintenance/setup/:id\r\nBody (penalty field):\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"type\": \"ALL\",\r\n  \"maintenanceAmount\": 2000,\r\n  \"penaltyPercent\": 5,     // optional, 0–21. Omit/0/null = no penalty\r\n  \"billingYear\": 2026\r\n  // …other setup fields…\r\n}\r\nResponse echoes:\r\n\r\n\r\n{ \"penaltyPercent\": 5, \"penaltyAmount\": 100 }  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nManual Invoice creation — the treasurer-invoices page\r\nAuth: Bearer <token> (society_treasurer app user).\r\n\r\nAction	App endpoint\r\nCreate	POST /api/app-treasurer/invoices\r\nList	GET /api/app-treasurer/invoices\r\nGet one	GET /api/app-treasurer/invoices/:id\r\n(An alternate app surface also exists: POST /api/app-account/invoice/create — same controller/service.)\r\n\r\nBody (penalty field):\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"penaltyPercent\": 10,    // optional, 0–21. Omit/0/null = no penalty. Stored as invoice.penaltyRate\r\n  // …all normal invoice fields (residentId/flatId, items, dueDate, gst, etc.) unchanged…\r\n}\r\nPenalty fields on every invoice (create response + list + get):\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"penaltyRate\": 10,            // the % chosen at creation (0–21)\r\n  \"penaltyAmount\": 0,          // 0 until charged; becomes the applied ₹ once overdue\r\n  \"penaltyApplied\": false,     // flips true once the late fee is applied\r\n  \"penaltyAppliedAt\": null     // timestamp when applied\r\n}\r\n','2026-07-11 05:41:04','2026-07-11 05:41:04',NULL,0),(4223,1137,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 05:57:31','2026-07-11 05:57:31',NULL,0),(4224,1664,'Issue',8,'i have integrated but we not show in resident login there penalty there login make it and update me','2026-07-11 06:51:08','2026-07-11 06:51:08',NULL,0),(4225,1665,'Issue',13,'POST { vendorName, phone, vendorTypeId?, type?, gstin?, pan?, address?, email?, contactPersonName?, bankAccountNo?, bankName?, bankIfsc?, tdsApplicable? } — vendorCode auto-generated\r\n\r\n\r\nVendor Service Type Master (new)\r\nMethod	Path	Body / notes\r\nGET	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types	paginated; ?search= — each item has vendorCount\r\nGET	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types/dropdown	active-only { id, name } — for the vendor vendorTypeId picker\r\nGET	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types/:id	single\r\nPOST	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types	{ name, description? } — name unique per society\r\nPUT	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types/:id	{ name?, description? }\r\nPUT	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types/:id/active	toggle isActive\r\nDELETE	/api/app-treasurer/masters/vendor-types/:id	soft delete; 400 if vendors still assigned\r\n','2026-07-11 07:04:08','2026-07-11 07:04:08',NULL,0),(4226,1674,'Issue',13,'Service-type picker\r\nGET /api/societygeneralmaster/servicetypemaster/get-app-staffservicetype-master\r\nAuth: authenticateAppUser([\'society_resident\',\'resident_family_member\',\'tenant_member\'])\r\n\r\nEach item now includes isOther. Show the free-text box when the selected item has isOther: true.\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"id\": \"uuid\",\r\n  \"staff_service_type\": \"Other\",\r\n  \"society_id\": null,\r\n  \"federation_id\": null,\r\n  \"isAddedByFederation\": false,\r\n  \"isOther\": true,\r\n  \"level\": \"default\",\r\n  \"isActive\": true,\r\n  \"isDeleted\": false,\r\n  \"createdAt\": \"…\",\r\n  \"updatedAt\": \"…\"\r\n}\r\n2. Add Staff (create)\r\nPOST /api/society/staffmanagement/app-staff/create · multipart/form-data\r\nAuth: authenticateAppUser([\'society_resident\',\'resident_family_member\',\'tenant_member\', ...])\r\n\r\nBody: name, gender, mobile, serviceTypeId (uuid), flats (JSON array), vendorId?, plus new optional otherServiceType (string, ≤150).\r\n\r\nRequired only when the chosen serviceTypeId resolves to an item with isOther: true → blank/missing returns 400 (\"Custom service type is required when \'Other\' is selected\").\r\nFor any normal type it\'s forced to null even if sent.\r\n3. Edit Staff (update)\r\nPUT /api/society/staffmanagement/app-staff/update/:id · multipart/form-data\r\nOptional serviceTypeId, otherServiceType, etc. Switching to Other requires the label; switching away nulls it automatically.\r\n\r\n4. Read / list (now return otherServiceType + isOther)\r\nDisplay otherServiceType when isOther, else the master staff_service_type name.\r\n\r\nGET /api/society/staffmanagement/app-staff/list\r\nGET /api/society/staffmanagement/app-staff/:id\r\nGET /api/society/staffmanagement/app-staff/search-by-mobile\r\ncreate/update responses\r\n','2026-07-11 08:24:40','2026-07-11 08:24:40',NULL,0),(4227,1504,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 08:26:03','2026-07-11 08:26:03',NULL,0),(4228,1733,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 08:26:19','2026-07-11 08:26:19',NULL,0),(4229,1146,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 08:26:37','2026-07-11 08:26:37',NULL,0),(4230,1664,'Issue',13,'Added four penalty fields to both resident invoice queries (resident-treasury.repository.ts) — the list and the detail — mirroring the admin list\'s shape:\r\n\r\nField	Type	Meaning\r\npenaltyRate	numeric	The % (0–21) that will apply if unpaid past due\r\npenaltyAmount	numeric	₹ actually charged — 0 until applied\r\npenaltyApplied	boolean	true once the late fee has been charged\r\npenaltyAppliedAt	timestamp | null	When it was charged\r\n\r\nEndpoints for the app \r\nBoth now return these fields (additive — nothing else changed):\r\n\r\n