c=\"clipboard-202607111512-7roti.png\"><br>\r\n','2026-07-11 09:43:33','2026-07-11 09:43:33',NULL,0),(4247,1491,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 09:43:54','2026-07-11 09:43:54',NULL,0),(4248,983,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:46:31','2026-07-11 09:46:31',NULL,0),(4249,982,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:46:45','2026-07-11 09:46:45',NULL,0),(4250,981,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:48:11','2026-07-11 09:48:11',NULL,0),(4251,1734,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 09:48:27','2026-07-11 09:48:27',NULL,0),(4252,496,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:48:30','2026-07-11 09:48:30',NULL,0),(4253,1687,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:49:08','2026-07-11 09:49:08',NULL,0),(4254,1680,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:51:35','2026-07-11 09:51:35',NULL,0),(4255,1136,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:54:46','2026-07-11 09:54:46',NULL,0),(4256,1494,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:58:13','2026-07-11 09:58:13',NULL,0),(4257,1497,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-11 09:58:25','2026-07-11 09:58:25',NULL,0),(4258,1674,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 10:02:21','2026-07-11 10:02:21',NULL,0),(4259,1135,'Issue',13,'GET /api/app-treasurer/ledger','2026-07-11 10:03:20','2026-07-11 10:03:20',NULL,0),(4260,1672,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 10:06:07','2026-07-11 10:06:07',NULL,0),(4261,1494,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 10:24:00','2026-07-11 10:24:00',NULL,0),(4262,1675,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 10:25:14','2026-07-11 10:25:14',NULL,0),(4263,1665,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 10:50:10','2026-07-11 10:50:10',NULL,0),(4264,1672,'Issue',13,'Step 1 — Resident opens \"Prepay Maintenance\" and picks a duration (3/6/9/12 months).\r\nThe app calls Preview (GET /maintenance/prepay/preview?months=6).\r\nThe backend looks at the resident\'s own flat, works out the monthly maintenance, and returns the total (e.g. \"6 months × ₹300 = ₹1,800\").\r\n👉 The app just shows this summary: \"You\'ll pay ₹1,800 for Aug–Jan.\"\r\n(The app doesn\'t calculate anything — the backend gives the amount.)\r\n\r\nStep 2 — Resident taps \"Pay\".\r\nThe app calls Initiate (POST /payments/initiatePrepayMaintenancePayment with just { months: 6 }).\r\nThe backend creates a Razorpay order for the correct amount and returns { orderId, amount, key }.\r\n👉 Important: the app does not send the amount or flat — the backend decides those from the logged-in resident. The app only sends how many months.\r\n\r\nStep 3 — Razorpay checkout opens.\r\nThe app opens the normal Razorpay payment popup using the key, orderId, and amount from Step 2 — exactly the same way it already does for the \"Advance Payment\" screen. The resident pays with UPI/card/etc.\r\n👉 Nothing new here — it\'s the same checkout code they already have.\r\n\r\nStep 4 — Payment succeeds → app calls Verify.\r\nRazorpay hands the app back three things: razorpay_order_id, razorpay_payment_id, razorpay_signature.\r\nThe app sends those to Verify (POST /payments/verifyPrepayMaintenancePayment).\r\nThe backend checks the payment is genuine, then automatically creates one paid invoice for each month and one receipt. It returns the receipt info: receiptNo, totalPaid, and the list of monthly invoices.\r\n👉 The app shows a success screen: \"Paid ₹1,800 — 6 months covered. Receipt: PAY-xxxx.\"\r\n\r\nStep 5 — Resident downloads the receipt.\r\nThe app calls the existing receipt endpoint POST /app-resident/payment/download-pdf with { \"id\": \"<orderId or paymentId>\" } → gets the PDF.\r\n👉 Same receipt-download the app already uses for other payments.\r\n\r\nAnd the 6 paid months now show up in the resident\'s normal Invoices list as PAID — each can be opened/downloaded too.','2026-07-11 11:00:19','2026-07-11 11:00:19',NULL,0),(4265,1663,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 11:00:55','2026-07-11 11:00:55',NULL,0),(4266,1127,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 11:05:40','2026-07-11 11:05:40',NULL,0),(4267,1491,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 11:07:09','2026-07-11 11:07:09',NULL,0),(4268,1504,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-11 11:08:11','2026-07-11 11:08:11',NULL,0),(4269,1664,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 12:09:44','2026-07-11 12:09:44',NULL,0),(4270,1672,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-11 12:44:55','2026-07-11 12:44:55',NULL,0),(4271,1497,'Issue',8,'give proper desciption on this ','2026-07-11 12:47:49','2026-07-11 12:47:49',NULL,0),(4272,1687,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-13 04:38:32','2026-07-13 04:38:32',NULL,0),(4273,1662,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-13 04:40:46','2026-07-13 04:40:46',NULL,0),(4274,1135,'Issue',8,'','2026-07-13 05:22:18','2026-07-13 05:22:18',NULL,0),(4275,1127,'Issue',13,'Show the \"Pay Now\" / \"Open\" button only when isPayable === true.\r\nWhen isPayable === false, render the status badge (Cancelled / Paid) instead — no action button. (The Invoice Details screen already does this correctly; apply the same logic to the list cards and the dashboard cards.)\r\n\r\nSample response — a CANCELLED invoice\r\nPOST /api/app-resident/invoice/list\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"code\": \"SUCCESS\",\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"invoices\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"b1f2c3d4-...-uuid\",\r\n        \"invoiceNo\": \"INV-1783917173039\",\r\n        \"invoiceDate\": \"2026-07-13\",\r\n        \"dueDate\": \"2026-07-18\",\r\n        \"billingPeriodStart\": null,\r\n        \"billingPeriodEnd\": null,\r\n        \"status\": \"CANCELLED\",\r\n        \"totalAmount\": \"500.00\",\r\n        \"paidAmount\": \"0.00\",\r\n        \"penaltyAmount\": \"0\",\r\n        \"isPayable\": false,\r\n        \"gatewayPaymentStatus\": \"NONE\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"pagination\": { \"currentPage\": 1, \"totalPages\": 1, \"totalItems\": 1, \"pageSize\": 10 }\r\n}','2026-07-13 05:30:47','2026-07-13 05:30:47',NULL,0),(4276,1127,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-13 05:30:57','2026-07-13 05:30:57',NULL,0),(4277,1666,'Issue',13,'POST /api/app-treasurer/invoices/bulk\r\n\r\nAuth: Authorization: Bearer <JWT> — role must be society_treasurer\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\nGenerates one invoice per flat, all sharing the same single line item and invoice/due dates. It loops per flat, so a failure on one flat does not abort the others (they\'re reported separately).\r\nRequest body\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"item\": {\r\n    \"lineItemMasterId\": \"uuid-or-null\",\r\n    \"description\": \"Gardening\",\r\n    \"accountId\": \"uuid-REQUIRED\",\r\n    \"quantity\": 1,\r\n    \"rate\": 500,\r\n    \"amount\": 500,\r\n    \"cgstAmount\": 0,\r\n    \"sgstAmount\": 0,\r\n    \"totalAmount\": 500\r\n  },\r\n  \"invoiceDate\": \"2026-07-13\",\r\n  \"dueDate\": \"2026-07-18\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Optional note applied to every invoice\",\r\n  \"termsAndConditions\": \"Optional\",\r\n  \"save_and_send\": true,\r\n  \"flats\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"flatId\": \"uuid\",\r\n      \"flatNumber\": \"A-101\",\r\n      \"buildingId\": \"uuid-or-null\",\r\n      \"wingId\": \"uuid-or-null\",\r\n      \"floorId\": \"uuid-or-null\",\r\n      \"residentId\": \"uuid-or-null\",\r\n      \"residentName\": \"aa\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"flatId\": \"uuid\",\r\n      \"flatNumber\": \"A-102\",\r\n      \"residentId\": \"uuid\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\nField rules\r\nField	Required	Notes\r\nitem.accountId	✅	Must be a valid ledger account UUID. Request is rejected (400) without it.\r\nitem.description, quantity, rate, amount, totalAmount	✅	The shared line item. GST fields optional (default 0). GST must be enabled for the society to use non-zero cgst/sgst.\r\ninvoiceDate, dueDate	✅	YYYY-MM-DD. Applied to every generated invoice.\r\nflats[]	✅	At least one. Empty array → 400.\r\nflats[].flatId / residentId	Recommended	These target who the invoice is billed to. Pass what your flat picker returns (mirror the web payload).\r\nsave_and_send	optional	true = each invoice is POSTED and sent (becomes visible to the resident app + triggers their notification). false/omitted = created as DRAFT (invisible to residents until posted separately). For the \"generate & send\" button, send true.\r\nResponse — 201 Created\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"code\": \"CREATED\",\r\n  \"message\": \"2 invoice(s) generated successfully\",\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"succeeded\": [\r\n      { \"flatId\": \"uuid\", \"flatNumber\": \"A-101\", \"residentName\": \"aa\",\r\n        \"invoiceId\": \"uuid\", \"invoiceNo\": \"INV-1783917173039\" },\r\n      { \"flatId\": \"uuid\", \"flatNumber\": \"A-102\", \"residentName\": \"bb\",\r\n        \"invoiceId\": \"uuid\", \"invoiceNo\": \"INV-1783917173040\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"failed\": [],\r\n    \"total\": 2,\r\n    \"generated\": 2,\r\n    \"failedCount\": 0\r\n  }\r\n}','2026-07-13 05:40:07','2026-07-13 05:40:07',NULL,0),(4278,1305,'Issue',13,'Changing, replacing, or deactivating a maintenance billing setup only affects bills created after the change. Bills that were already generated and sent keep their original amount — forever.','2026-07-13 06:02:33','2026-07-13 06:02:33',NULL,0),(4279,1489,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-13 06:09:09','2026-07-13 06:09:09',NULL,0),(4280,1743,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 07:30:45','2026-07-13 07:30:45',NULL,0),(4281,1750,'Issue',9,'','2026-07-13 10:57:17','2026-07-13 10:57:17',NULL,0),(4282,1732,'Issue',9,'','2026-07-13 10:57:47','2026-07-13 10:57:47',NULL,0),(4283,1492,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 11:19:45','2026-07-13 11:19:45',NULL,0),(4284,1735,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 12:21:58','2026-07-13 12:21:58',NULL,0),(4285,1734,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 12:22:52','2026-07-13 12:22:52',NULL,0),(4286,1733,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 12:24:06','2026-07-13 12:24:06',NULL,0),(4287,1682,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 12:26:51','2026-07-13 12:26:51',NULL,0),(4288,1681,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-13 12:27:21','2026-07-13 12:27:21',NULL,0),(4289,1678,'Issue',7,'<img style=\"width: 1562px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607131800-0iw1x.png\"><br>\r\ngive here a multi select option.','2026-07-13 12:30:20','2026-07-13 12:30:20',NULL,0),(4290,1670,'Issue',7,'','2026-07-14 05:44:38','2026-07-14 05:44:38',NULL,0),(4291,1669,'Issue',7,'<img style=\"width: 1591px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607141121-ll8pj.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\nplease chek the scenario. tere is no flat ledger balance shown.','2026-07-14 05:51:32','2026-07-