"timestamp\": \"2026-07-24T11:07:39.604Z\"\r\n}','2026-07-27 06:28:39','2026-07-27 06:28:39',NULL,0),(4617,1784,'Issue',13,'PUT /api/app-treasurer/bills/:id/with-attachment  \r\nAction	Call\r\nOpen edit form	GET /app-treasurer/bills/:id → returns attachmentUrl (+ vendor)\r\nSave edit, keep attachment	PUT /app-treasurer/bills/:id (JSON, omit attachmentUrl)\r\nSave edit, set URL directly	PUT /app-treasurer/bills/:id (JSON with attachmentUrl)\r\nSave edit, upload/replace file	PUT /app-treasurer/bills/:id/with-attachment (multipart, field attachment)\r\n\r\nsend the new attachmentUrl in the JSON body.\r\nuse PUT /app-treasurer/bills/:id/with-attachment (file field attachment).\r\nAnd to show the attachment when opening the edit form → read attachmentUrl from GET /app-treasurer/bills/:id.\r\n\r\n Same rule: don\'t send the raw file to plain PUT /bills/:id — only a URL in the body.','2026-07-27 06:43:16','2026-07-27 06:43:16',NULL,0),(4618,1845,'Issue',7,'101\r\n\r\n<img style=\"width: 369px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607271212-jcogh.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n102\r\n\r\n<img style=\"width: 310px;\" src=\"clipboard-202607271213-rupdw.png\"><br>\r\n','2026-07-27 06:43:19','2026-07-27 06:43:19',NULL,0),(4619,1797,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-27 06:53:03','2026-07-27 06:53:03',NULL,0),(4620,1806,'Issue',13,'','2026-07-27 06:57:05','2026-07-27 06:57:05',NULL,0),(4621,1806,'Issue',13,'Ticket list — send the active flat:\r\n\r\n\r\nGET /.../support-ticket/buyer?flatId=<activeFlatId>&page=1&limit=10\r\nAdd flatId = the currently-selected flat\'s id.\r\nWhen the resident switches flat, call this again with the new flatId → the list refreshes to that flat\'s tickets.\r\nIf flatId is not sent, the backend uses the resident\'s stored active flat.\r\n2. Create ticket — send the flat it\'s for:\r\n\r\n\r\nPOST /.../support-ticket   (existing create call)\r\nbody: { subjectId, description, flatId: <activeFlatId>, ... }\r\nAdd flatId = the resident\'s current flat.\r\nIf not sent, the backend uses the flat