5758,1917,'Issue',8,'give me api and md file','2026-08-25 11:49:25','2026-08-25 11:49:25',NULL,0),(5759,2131,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:50:19','2026-08-25 11:50:19',NULL,0),(5760,2048,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:52:02','2026-08-25 11:52:02',NULL,0),(5761,2044,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:52:37','2026-08-25 11:52:37',NULL,0),(5762,2043,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:53:14','2026-08-25 11:53:14',NULL,0),(5763,2042,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:53:33','2026-08-25 11:53:33',NULL,0),(5764,2040,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 11:56:18','2026-08-25 11:56:18',NULL,0),(5765,2372,'Issue',8,'','2026-08-25 11:57:44','2026-08-25 11:57:44',NULL,0),(5766,1917,'Issue',13,'\r\n Journal Correction Flow\r\n 1. Treasurer creates journal\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/app-treasurer/journal\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"journal\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"journal-id\",\r\n      \"status\": \"DRAFT\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Treasurer sends journal to Society Admin\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/app-treasurer/journal/{journalId}/submit\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse status changes:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nDRAFT -> PENDING_APPROVAL\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"journal\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"journal-id\",\r\n      \"status\": \"PENDING_APPROVAL\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Society Admin checks the journal\r\n\r\nList journals:\r\n\r\n```http\r\nGET /api/app-admin/journal?status=PENDING_APPROVAL\r\n```\r\n\r\nGet one journal:\r\n\r\n```http\r\nGET /api/app-admin/journal/{journalId}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe admin should see journal lines, amount, narration, maker, and date.\r\n\r\n### 4. Society Admin rejects the journal\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/app-admin/journal/{journalId}/reject\r\n```\r\n\r\nRequest body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"reason\": \"Wrong expense account selected. Please change it to Administrative Expense.\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`reason` is required.\r\n\r\nResponse status changes:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nPENDING_APPROVAL -> REJECTED\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"journal\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"journal-id\",\r\n      \"status\": \"REJECTED\",\r\n      \"rejectionReason\": \"Wrong expense account selected. Please change it to Administrative Expense.\",\r\n      \"rejectedBy\": \"admin-id\",\r\n      \"rejectedAt\": \"2026-08-25T...\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe treasurer receives a rejection notification and can see the rejection reason.\r\n\r\n### 5. Treasurer opens rejected journal\r\n\r\n```http\r\nGET /api/app-treasurer/journal/{journalId}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe app should check:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nstatus == \"REJECTED\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen show:\r\n\r\n- Journal details\r\n- Rejection reason\r\n- Edit button\r\n- Resubmit button\r\n\r\n### 6. Treasurer corrects the journal\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPUT /api/app-treasurer/journal/{journalId}\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"entryDate\": \"2026-08-25\",\r\n  \"narration\": \"Corrected maintenance expense\",\r\n  \"journalType\": \"MANUAL\",\r\n  \"lines\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"accountId\": \"expense-account-id\",\r\n      \"debit\": 100,\r\n      \"credit\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"accountId\": \"cash-account-id\",\r\n      \"debit\": 0,\r\n      \"credit\": 100\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnly the original treasurer who created the journal can edit it.\r\n\r\n### 7. Treasurer sends corrected journal again\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/app-treasurer/journal/{journalId}/submit\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse status changes:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nREJECTED -> PENDING_APPROVAL\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe Society Admin receives a new “Journal Resubmitted” notification.\r\n\r\n### 8. Society Admin approves corrected journal\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/app-admin/journal/{journalId}/approve\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse status changes:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nPENDING_APPROVAL -> POSTED\r\n```\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": {\r\n    \"journal\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"journal-id\",\r\n      \"status\": \"POSTED\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter approval, ledger entries are created.\r\n\r\n## Simple Status Flow\r\n\r\n```text\r\nDRAFT\r\n  -> PENDING_APPROVAL\r\n  -> REJECTED\r\n  -> edit correction\r\n  -> PENDING_APPROVAL\r\n  -> POSTED\r\n```\r\n\r\nImportant points \r\n\r\n- Admin rejection must include a `reason`.\r\n- Treasurer can edit only `DRAFT` or `REJECTED` journals.\r\n- Treasurer must submit again after making corrections.\r\n- Admin cannot approve a journal created by the same user.\r\n- `POSTED`, `VOIDED`, and `REVERSED` journals cannot be edited.','2026-08-25 12:01:46','2026-08-25 12:01:46',NULL,0),(5767,1917,'Issue',13,'','2026-08-25 12:01:55','2026-08-25 12:01:55',NULL,0),(5768,2038,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:28:03','2026-08-25 12:28:03',NULL,0),(5769,2036,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:30:05','2026-08-25 12:30:05',NULL,0),(5770,2034,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:38:45','2026-08-25 12:38:45',NULL,0),(5771,2033,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:39:21','2026-08-25 12:39:21',NULL,0),(5772,2032,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:39:35','2026-08-25 12:39:35',NULL,0),(5773,2031,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:39:54','2026-08-25 12:39:54',NULL,0),(5774,2030,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:40:15','2026-08-25 12:40:15',NULL,0),(5775,2029,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:40:43','2026-08-25 12:40:43',NULL,0),(5776,2028,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:41:26','2026-08-25 12:41:26',NULL,0),(5777,2027,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:41:48','2026-08-25 12:41:48',NULL,0),(5778,2026,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:42:15','2026-08-25 12:42:15',NULL,0),(5779,2025,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:43:16','2026-08-25 12:43:16',NULL,0),(5780,2024,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:44:33','2026-08-25 12:44:33',NULL,0),(5781,2023,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:45:02','2026-08-25 12:45:02',NULL,0),(5782,2020,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:46:12','2026-08-25 12:46:12',NULL,0),(5783,2019,'Issue',7,'','2026-08-25 12:46:5