NULL,0),(6488,2453,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 12:58:58','2026-09-10 12:58:58',NULL,0),(6489,2449,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 12:59:51','2026-09-10 12:59:51',NULL,0),(6490,2436,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:01:28','2026-09-10 13:01:28',NULL,0),(6491,2435,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:01:52','2026-09-10 13:01:52',NULL,0),(6492,2433,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:02:11','2026-09-10 13:02:11',NULL,0),(6493,2430,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:02:24','2026-09-10 13:02:24',NULL,0),(6494,2429,'Issue',7,'please check sakshi that why another federation shows here.','2026-09-10 13:05:05','2026-09-10 13:05:05',NULL,0),(6495,2424,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:05:32','2026-09-10 13:05:32',NULL,0),(6496,2386,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:05:42','2026-09-10 13:05:42',NULL,0),(6497,2448,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:12:03','2026-09-10 13:12:03',NULL,0),(6498,1943,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-10 13:12:30','2026-09-10 13:12:30',NULL,0),(6499,2468,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-11 04:52:52','2026-09-11 04:52:52',NULL,0),(6500,1779,'Issue',13,'// show the reminder button only when BOTH are true\r\ninvoice.status === \'POSTED\' && invoice.canSendReminder !== false\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Billing History list\r\n\r\nGET /api/app-treasurer/billing/history?page=1&limit=20\r\nOptional filters (unchanged): year, month, flatType, status, search, fromDate, toDate, flatId\r\n\r\nResponse\r\n\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"success\": true,\r\n  \"data\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"ca5d2e8c-a069-4cdc-9b76-50754964ab1a\",\r\n      \"invoiceNo\": \"INV-1789033441764\",\r\n      \"invoiceDate\": \"2026-09-01\",\r\n      \"dueDate\": \"2026-09-06\",\r\n      \"status\": \"POSTED\",\r\n      \"totalAmount\": \"225.00\",\r\n      \"paidAmount\": \"0.00\",\r\n      \"residentId\": null,\r\n      \"residentName\": null,\r\n      \"flatNumbers\": null,\r\n      \"canSendReminder\": false\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"6124069c-c47d-49a8-87db-e5af5bde6aa3\",\r\n      \"invoiceNo\": \"INV-1789033441175\",\r\n      \"invoiceDate\": \"2026-09-01\",\r\n      \"dueDate\": \"2026-09-06\",\r\n      \"status\": \"POSTED\",\r\n      \"totalAmount\": \"225.00\",\r\n      \"paidAmount\": \"0.00\",\r\n      \"residentId\": \"bbaaa115-0f8e-426f-a57b-bff1d75c2e51\",\r\n      \"residentName\": \"Ram\",\r\n      \"flatNumbers\": [\"1A-A01\", \"2A-A01\"],\r\n      \"canSendReminder\": true\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"pagination\": { \"currentPage\": 1, \"totalPages\": 2, \"totalItems\": 20, \"pageSize\": 10 },\r\n  \"summary\": { }\r\n}\r\ncanSendReminder is the new field. true = somebody is attached to that flat, false = nobody, so a reminder cannot be delivered.\r\n\r\n2. Bill detail\r\n\r\nGET /api/app-treasurer/billing/history/:id\r\nSame canSendReminder field on the invoice object (plus items, residentEmail, residentMobile, paymentMode). Use it to hide the Send Reminder button inside the detail screen too.\r\n\r\n3. Send reminder (unchanged)\r\n\r\nPOST /api/app-treasurer/billing/history/:id/reminder\r\nWhat to change in the app\r\nShow the reminder button only when both are true:\r\n\r\n\r\nconst showReminder = invoice.status === \'POSTED\' && invoice.canSendReminder !== false;\r\nUse !== false, not === true — that way the button still works if the app ever runs against an older build that doesn\'t send the field.\r\n\r\nApply it in two places: the list row action, and the Send Reminder button on the bill detail screen.','2026-09-11 05:13:40','2026-09-11 05:13:40',NULL,0),(6501,2449,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 05:15:45','2026-09-11 05:15:45',NULL,0),(6502,2457,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 05:15:52','2026-09-11 05:15:52',NULL,0),(6503,2464,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-11 05:30:29','2026-09-11 05:30:29',NULL,0),(6504,2446,'Issue',13,'Right now the app just says \"toggle this staff\" without saying ON or OFF. The backend then flips whatever it finds.\r\n\r\nYour app is sending that request twice for one tap. So it flips twice — OFF, then back ON. That\'s why it always ends up enabled.\r\n\r\nWhat to do\r\n1. Send the new position\r\n\r\nWhen the user moves the switch, send the value the switch moved to:\r\n\r\n\r\nPUT /api/society/app-staff/{staffId}/isactive\r\n\r\n{ \"isActiveForMe\": false }    // user switched it OFF\r\n{ \"isActiveForMe\": true }     // user switched it ON\r\nNow even if the request goes twice by mistake, nothing breaks — the second one just sets the same value again.\r\n\r\n2. Show the switch using isActiveForMe\r\n\r\nThis key comes back in:\r\n\r\nthe list → GET /api/society/app-staff/list\r\nthe toggle response\r\nthe detail → GET /api/society/app-staff/{id}\r\n\r\nswitchValue = staff.isActiveForMe\r\n3. Do NOT use isActive\r\n\r\nisActive is the society admin\'s global setting for that staff member. It is not the resident\'s own setting. Using it will show the wrong position.\r\n\r\n4. Fix the double call\r\n\r\nPlease also check why the request fires twice on one tap. It is common in React Native when the Switch onChange fires and the screen also refreshes. After the change above the bug is gone either way, but one tap should send one request.','2026-09-11 05:37:51','2026-09-11 05:37:51',NULL,0),(6505,2402,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 06:03:09','2026-09-11 06:03:09',NULL,0),(6506,2429,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 06:42:49','2026-09-11 06:42:49',NULL,0),(6507,2434,'Issue',13,'Call the API like this\r\n\r\n\r\nGET /api/visitormanagement/federation-gate/visitors?scope=pending\r\nJust add scope=pending. That\'s the whole change.\r\n\r\n2. Do NOT send status on this screen\r\n\r\nDon\'t send status=Pending. It looks correct but it gives the wrong list — it pulls in pending visitors logged by society guards, which this screen should not show, and it misses some that the card does count.\r\n\r\nscope=pending gives you exactly the same visitors as the Pending Approval count on the dashboard. The number and the list will always match.\r\n\r\n3. Remove the \"Pending\" default from the filter box\r\n\r\nSince the screen is now pending-only, the Status filter box should not show \"Pending\" as a default value. Either remove the filter from this screen, or leave it blank.\r\n\r\n4. Add a proper empty message\r\n\r\nImportant — right now this screen will be empty, and that is correct. There are no pending visitors in the federation at the moment.\r\n\r\nSo please show something like \"No pending approvals\" instead of a blank screen','2026-09-11 07:01:56','2026-09-11 07:01:56',NULL,0),(6508,2418,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 07:03:06','2026-09-11 07:03:06',NULL,0),(6509,2405,'Issue',13,'','2026-09-11 07:09:56','2026-09-11 07:09:56',NULL,0),(6510,2488,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 08:46:08','2026-09-11 08:46:08',NULL,0),(6511,2469,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 08:53:25','2026-09-11 08:53:25',NULL,0),(6512,2472,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 08:53:36','2026-09-11 08:53:36',NULL,0),(6513,2473,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 08:53:59','2026-09-11 08:53:59',NULL,0),(6514,2474,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 08:54:11','2026-09-11 08:54:11',NULL,0),(6515,2471,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:16:01','2026-09-11 09:16:01',NULL,0),(6516,2475,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:19:51','2026-09-11 09:19:51',NULL,0),(6517,2493,'Issue',7,'','2026-09-11 09:20:07','2026-09-11 09:20:07',NULL,0),(6518,2476,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:25:10','2026-09-11 09:25:10',NULL,0),(6519,2477,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:36:09','2026-09-11 09:36:09',NULL,0),(6520,2478,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:53:30','2026-09-11 09:53:30',NULL,0),(6521,2479,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:53:49','2026-09-11 09:53:49',NULL,0),(6522,2480,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 09:55:11','2026-09-11 09:55:11',NULL,0),(6523,2481,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:05:32','2026-09-11 10:05:32',NULL,0),(6524,2482,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:07:28','2026-09-11 10:07:28',NULL,0),(6525,2483,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:07:47','2026-09-11 10:07:47',NULL,0),(6526,2484,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:16:39','2026-09-11 10:16:39',NULL,0),(6527,2485,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:21:43','2026-09-11 10:21:43',NULL,0),(6528,2486,'Issue',12,'','2026-09-11 10:26:11','2026-09-11 10:26:11',